===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|es|México}}, from {{der|en|nci|Mēxihco}}, a place-name referring to the {{m|nci|mexihcah|Mēxihcah}} ([[Mexica]]/[[Aztec]]s).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈmɛk.sɪ.kəʊ/|a=UK}}
** {{IPA|en|/ˈmɛ.hi.kəʊ/|a=UK,less commonly}}
* {{a|en|US}} {{enPR|mĕkʹ-sĭ-kō}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈmɛk.sɪ.koʊ/}}
** {{IPA|en|/ˈmɛ.hi.koʊ/|a=US,less commonly}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-Mexico.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|Mex|i|co}}

